    <bpmn:process id="W_W1743" name="W1743. Vendor &amp; Supplier Notification for New Store" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New store opening confirmed (target date set per W1737)
Frequency: ~10–15 notifications/year
Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors notified per new store
Owner: VP Supply Chain
Participants: VP Supply Chain, Category Managers, Procurement, Key Account Vendors
Source: workflow W1743 — Vendor &amp; Supplier Notification for New Store</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1743_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1743_Lane1" name="VP Supply Chain">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1743_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1743_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1743_Lane2" name="Category Managers">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1743_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1743_Lane3" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1743_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1743_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1743_Start5" name="New store opening confirmed (target date set per W1737)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1743_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1743_Task6" name="VP Supply Chain notifies all active vendors of new store opening: (a) mass…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Supply Chain notifies all active vendors of new store opening: (a) mass notification via vendor portal per VS-03, (b) store details: number, location, opening date, DC assignment, (c) DSD vendors: specific instructions for delivery to new store (address, receiving hours, contact person), (d) VMI vendors: update VMI parameters for new store location
Responsible (R): VP Supply Chain / Procurement
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1743_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1743_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1743_Task7" name="Category Managers contact top 20 vendors individually: (a) discuss initial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers contact top 20 vendors individually: (a) discuss initial stock allocation and opening promotions, (b) negotiate opening-day promotional support (vendor-funded discounts, free goods, display fixtures), (c) confirm product availability for new store opening, (d) update vendor master data with new store as delivery location
Responsible (R): Category Managers
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1743_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1743_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1743_Task8" name="Procurement updates vendor master and purchasing parameters: (a) add new store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Procurement updates vendor master and purchasing parameters: (a) add new store to replenishment system, (b) update ROP and safety stock for new store location, (c) configure auto-replenishment rules for new store, (d) add new store to existing blanket purchase orders where applicable
Responsible (R): Procurement / Merchandise Planners
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1743_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1743_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1743_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1743_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-352 (ensure controlled execution — New Store Project Planning &amp; Coordination (PA-37.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: VP Supply Chain</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
